          "class": "Tinkerer",
          "description": "<p>When you create a potion or magisphere whose effects restore HP and/or MP, each<br>restored amount is increased by <strong>【SL &times; 5】</strong>.<br>When you create an elemental shard, potion or magisphere that deals damage, that<br>item deals <strong>【SL】</strong> extra damage.</p>",
