        "1": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Tinkerer",
          "description": "<p><strong>Basic Alchemy Gadget </strong>Roll two [[/r d20]] and assign one to target and one to effect.</p>\n<hr>\n<table style=\"width: 100%; height: 85px;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 13.0601%;\"><col style=\"width: 86.9399%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 17px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 17px;\"><strong>TARGET</strong></td>\n<td style=\"height: 17px;\"><strong>The potion affects...</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 17px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 17px;\">1-6</td>\n<td style=\"height: 17px;\">you or one ally you can see that is present on the scene.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 17px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 17px;\">7-11</td>\n<td style=\"height: 17px;\">one enemy you can see that is present on the scene.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 17px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 17px;\">12-16</td>\n<td style=\"height: 17px;\">you and every ally present on the scene.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 17px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 17px;\">17-20</td>\n<td style=\"height: 17px;\">every enemy present on the scene.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"width: 100%; height: 493px;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 17.5573%;\"><col style=\"width: 82.3473%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 17px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 17px;\"><strong>EFFECT</strong></td>\n<td style=\"height: 17px;\"><strong>Each creature affected by the potion...</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 17px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 17px;\">Any</td>\n<td style=\"height: 17px;\">suffers 20 <strong>poison</strong> damage.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 17px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 17px;\">Any</td>\n<td style=\"height: 17px;\">recovers 30 Hit Points</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 34px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 34px;\">1</td>\n<td style=\"height: 34px;\">...treats their <strong>Dexterity</strong> and <strong>Might</strong> dice as if they were one size higher<br>(up to a maximum of d12) until the end of your next turn.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 17px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 17px;\">2</td>\n<td style=\"height: 17px;\">As effect 1, but with<strong> Insight</strong> and <strong>Willpower</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 34px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 34px;\">3</td>\n<td style=\"height: 34px;\">... suffers 20 <strong>air</strong> damage. This amount increases to 30 damage if you are<br>level 20 or higher, or to 40 damage if you are level 40 or higher.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 34px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 34px;\">4</td>\n<td style=\"height: 34px;\">... suffers 20<strong> bolt</strong> damage. This amount increases to 30 damage if you are<br>level 20 or higher, or to 40 damage if you are level 40 or higher.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 34px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 34px;\">5</td>\n<td style=\"height: 34px;\">... suffers 20 <strong>dark</strong> damage. This amount increases to 30 damage if you are<br>level 20 or higher, or to 40 damage if you are level 40 or higher.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 34px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 34px;\">6</td>\n<td style=\"height: 34px;\">... suffers 20 <strong>earth</strong> damage. This amount increases to 30 damage if you are<br>level 20 or higher, or to 40 damage if you are level 40 or higher.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 34px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 34px;\">7</td>\n<td style=\"height: 34px;\">... suffers 20 <strong>fire</strong> damage. This amount increases to 30 damage if you are<br>level 20 or higher, or to 40 damage if you are level 40 or higher.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 34px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 34px;\">8</td>\n<td style=\"height: 34px;\">... suffers 20 <strong>ice</strong> damage. This amount increases to 30 damage if you are<br>level 20 or higher, or to 40 damage if you are level 40 or higher.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 17px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 17px;\">9</td>\n<td style=\"height: 17px;\">... gains Resistance to<strong> air</strong> and fire damage until the end of the scene.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 17px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 17px;\">10</td>\n<td style=\"height: 17px;\">... gains Resistance to <strong>bolt</strong> and ice damage until the end of the scene.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 17px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 17px;\">11</td>\n<td style=\"height: 17px;\">... gains Resistance to <strong>dark</strong> and earth damage until the end of the scene.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 17px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 17px;\">12</td>\n<td style=\"height: 17px;\">... suffers <strong>enraged</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 17px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 17px;\">13</td>\n<td style=\"height: 17px;\">... suffers <strong>poisoned.</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 17px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 17px;\">14</td>\n<td style=\"height: 17px;\">... suffers <strong>dazed</strong>, <strong>shaken</strong>, <strong>slow</strong> and <strong>weak</strong>.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 17px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 17px;\">15</td>\n<td style=\"height: 17px;\">... recovers from all status effects.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 17px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 17px;\">16-17</td>\n<td style=\"height: 17px;\">... recovers 50 Hit Points and 50 Mind Points.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 17px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 17px;\">18</td>\n<td style=\"height: 17px;\">... recovers 100 Hit Points.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 17px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 17px;\">19</td>\n<td style=\"height: 17px;\">... recovers 100 Mind Points.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 17px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 17px;\">20</td>\n<td style=\"height: 17px;\">... recovers 100 Hit Points and 100 Mind Points.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
